# Python neuro-engine

- Python 3.12 via uv; use type annotations, explicit schemas, Ruff and pytest.
- Device adapter must expose capabilities, sampling rate, reference, channel labels, units and timestamps; do not hard-code 16 channels in generic processing.
- Raw samples remain immutable after capture. Process in bounded buffers; separate acquisition, raw persistence, artifact annotation and derived pipelines.
- Handle disconnections, dropped/duplicate/out-of-order packets and invalid device configurations deterministically.
- Treat DSP/filtering, artifact handling and source inversion as parameterized, versioned computations; test on known synthetic signals.
- Never perform training or expensive MRI segmentation in the EEG acquisition event loop. Document actual sampling/latency rather than inferred rates.
